IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FASTGEN-SPLITKV.

DATA DIVISION.
01 SEQ-LEN             PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 HEAD-DIM            PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 NUM-SPLITS          PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 CAPACITY-K          PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FASTGEN-SPLITKV.
    IF SEQ-LEN == 0 OR HEAD-DIM == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF NUM-SPLITS == 0
        MOVE 4 TO NUM-SPLITS.
    END-IF.

    MOVE SEQ-LEN TO CAPACITY-K.
    MULTIPLY HEAD-DIM BY CAPACITY-K.
    DIVIDE 1024 INTO CAPACITY-K.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 CAPACITY-K.
    WEIGHT 30 NUM-SPLITS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
